    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Always in Mind is a story-driven action-platforming adventure that takes place where technology and the mind combine.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Paired with a miraculous AI named Proxy, Teddy must master the awe-inspiring powers of his mind in order to escape it, or risk becoming trapped in thought forever.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Epic Adventure</h2>Wield powers beyond belief as you explore your family's history: manifest memories, slow the passage of time, and turn the world upside-down.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Effortless Exploration</h2>Jump, Slide, Glide, and Warp through every corner of Teddy\u2019s mind<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stellar Story-Telling</h2>Immerse yourself in a world of visual splendor, intricate level design, and an unforgettable original soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Artificial Friendship</h2>Bond with Proxy through countless cinematic encounters without ever relinquishing control. His code is the key to re-connecting with your family.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>A story from the heart experienced within the mind: it's time to embark upon a coming-of-age tale for the ages, and discover why true change only comes from within.</i><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2c0a730265c67f1dc8c02040a2032d97.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Always in Mind is a story-driven action-platforming adventure that takes place where technology and the mind combine.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/ab5201e5516c61504cc189d7f1e0e358.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Paired with a miraculous AI named Proxy, Teddy must master the awe-inspiring powers of his mind in order to escape it, or risk becoming trapped in thought forever.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/46c465cf12eb4125ab4aa0aba494dcba.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Epic Adventure</h2>Wield powers beyond belief as you explore your family's history: manifest memories, slow the passage of time, and turn the world upside-down.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/2980d1768c932e694e96dd9eb508181d.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Effortless Exploration</h2>Jump, Slide, Glide, and Warp through every corner of Teddy\u2019s mind<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/266c69eb24ba68c64b1eb5296b2dd55e.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stellar Story-Telling</h2>Immerse yourself in a world of visual splendor, intricate level design, and an unforgettable original soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/11f445753134f0017d9680149c59b326.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Artificial Friendship</h2>Bond with Proxy through countless cinematic encounters without ever relinquishing control. His code is the key to re-connecting with your family.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.poster.avif?t=1748972499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.webm?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156950/extras/f4e93d10b9a5819cb526e69294c02bef.mp4?t=1748972499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>A story from the heart experienced within the mind: it's time to embark upon a coming-of-age tale for the ages, and discover why true change only comes from within.</i><br><br>",
    "short_description": "With Proxy as your ever-entertaining guide, you'll explore the outer reaches of Teddy's vast and surreal subconscious, uncovering powers beyond imagination as you race to achieve consciousness before glitches in Proxy's code bring your unbelievable adventure to an end.",
